<title>UK: GOLF-SOLHEIM CUP FOURBALLS PAIRINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOLHEIM CUP FOURBALLS PAIRINGS.</headline>
<dateline>CHEPSTOW, Wales 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pairings for afternoon fourballs in the Solheim Cup women's team golf match between the United States and Europe at St Pierre on Friday (U.S. names first): Kelly Robbins/Pat Bradley v Laura Davies/Trish Johnson (Britain) Val Skinner/Jane Geddes v Annika Sorenstam (Sweden)/Kathryn Marshall (Britain) Dottie Pepper/Betsy King v Liselotte Neumann/Catrin Nilsmark (Sweden) Meg Mallon/Beth Daniel v Helen Alfredsson (Sweden)/Alison Nicholas (Britain)</p>
</text>
